This distribution contains a modified derivative of the FastFit Model. The
upstream `module/` and `parse_utils/` runtime trees are vendored under the
`fastfit/` package and integrated with a separate HTTP job service, storage
lifecycle, command-line interface, and model-download policy.

This distribution also includes the minimal runtime subset of Easy DWPose
1.0.2 under `fastfit/vendor/easy_dwpose/`. Easy DWPose is licensed under the
Apache License 2.0; its license text is retained at
`fastfit/vendor/easy_dwpose/LICENSE`. The vendored copy omits unrelated demo
and integration modules and changes only its package/import location so the
FastFit runtime can use the selected dependency versions without installing
the conflicting `easy-dwpose` distribution metadata.
